    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Fidget</strong> is a fun and interactive desktop toybox filled with quirky virtual fidgets. It\u2019s designed to sit alongside your everyday workflow or gaming session, turning your desktop into a space where creativity meets playful distraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.poster.avif?t=1752119358\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.webm?t=1752119358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.mp4?t=1752119358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/a3f2ead2780d3527bb390f23985661b0.avif?t=1752119358\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling tense? Just <strong>click, drag, spin, or mash</strong> your favorite fidgets to blow off steam. Every tap is oddly satisfying, like popping bubble wrap, but better. These small actions help <strong>keep your hands active</strong> and <strong>your mind calm</strong> during long hours at the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.poster.avif?t=1752119358\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.webm?t=1752119358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.mp4?t=1752119358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/d500bb68cfbd689962389e8ec87c49e0.avif?t=1752119358\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These fidgets aren't just for show, they <strong>react to you</strong>. <strong>Blow into your mic</strong> to inflate a virtual bag, or <strong>connect your camera</strong> to turn a fidget into a goofy mirror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.poster.avif?t=1752119358\" width=800 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.webm?t=1752119358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.mp4?t=1752119358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4302078ffc2176636232a1669a9e2b28.avif?t=1752119358\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resize, move, and arrange</strong> your fidgets however you like. Create your own personal chaos, or harmony right on your screen. It\u2019s your space. Make it fidget-worthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.poster.avif?t=1752119358\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.webm?t=1752119358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.mp4?t=1752119358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/762f2253ef0ca281f25742f50ae4cb05.avif?t=1752119358\" width=608 height=200 /></span><strong>Demo Version:</strong> Includes 7 sample fidgets to try out.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Release: F</strong>eatures 20 fidgets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Release Content:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Pixel Asset Pack</strong> \u2013 Expand your creativity with extra visual assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fidget DLC Pack</strong> \u2013 Add 10 brand-new fidgets to your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to the custom <strong>Fidget Workshop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/a507c0c29199fa23c38391d0e9a6c6fa.avif?t=1752119358\" data-has-big width=800 height=585 /></span></p>",
